// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P156495621" ""Ready to cause some mayhem in Paragon City? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to Skyway City and hit one of the banks there.</A> Once you hit Skyway you'll have 15 minutes to rob the bank and escape."<br><br><color deepskyblue>This is a Mayhem Mission. You can earn extra time by destroying property and creating diversions away from the bank itself.<br><br>Each type of item rewards a single time bonus after you destroy a certain number of that item. For each person on your team, you will need to destroy more of that particular item to get the time bonus.<br><br>Two random side missions can be found on this map. Keys (found by defeating certain enemies) are needed to unlock these side missions. Each completed side mission also rewards a time bonus.<br><br>Every character that is at least level 15 receives a special temporary power the first time they successfully complete this mission.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2399196939" "Rob Skyway City bank"
